# Repository instructions

At the start of every chat or task in this project, read and follow `AGENTS.md` at the repository root.

- `AGENTS.md` is the canonical source of agent rules (any model or platform).
- Do not invent local policies that contradict `AGENTS.md`.
- If a Cursor rule and `AGENTS.md` diverge, `AGENTS.md` prevails and the rule must be aligned.
- For the day-one working set, layer map (outline → script → storyboard → prompt), and upward-propagation gate, also open `docs/AGENT_ONBOARDING.md` when the task is narrative or production.
- Language, canon, migration, and validation policy: see `AGENTS.md` (do not duplicate detail here).
